From 8008a83d8f9978e9b7bab95ad0888289018cb367 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:09:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Deal finder for agents: fix and flips, one press

Homes for sale with a reason to be cheap, ranked by how far their asking
price a square foot sits under what houses like them sold for nearby.
It never puts a value on a house (an automated value is a separate MLS
licence we do not have). The agent types the after-repair value and the
page does the flip math and the 70 percent rule's offer. The AI reads the
photos of the first 12 for a repair figure.
